    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21613" root="شبك" body-key="$">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَبَّاكٌ</span></b>  means <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَنْ يَعْمَلُ الشِّبَاكَ الوَطِيَّاتِ</span> [app. <i>A
maker of soft netted fabrics of thongs for</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَحَامِل</span>;
(see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شِبَاكٌ</span>, latter sentence;) supposing <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الوَطِيَّاتِ</span> to
be for <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الوَطِيْئَاتِ</span>, agreeably with a well-known
license]. (TA.)

